  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia Kigali HFC implementation plan preparation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to support the preparation of UNEP&#x2019;s non-investment components for incorporation into Serbia&#x2019;s KIP. In the context of this project, UNEP acts as the cooperating agency. The following activities are included in the project: preparation of initial HFC related policies and legislation, a communication and outreach plan, and a national strategy to improve energy efficiency of cooling equipment, and the review of international performance standards.</narrative>
  </description>
